{"panneau":"cameras","panneauNom":"Caméras et appareils connectés","passages":[{"id":52,"page":"cameras.html","ancre":"cameras-transit","titre":"Ce qui transite d'une caméra domestique — le documenté","panneau":"Caméras et appareils connectés","texte":"1 Ce qui transite d'une caméra domestique — le documenté Ce qui part de chez toi quand une caméra domestique filme : le modèle documenté par le cas Ring — qui détient tes images, qui y a eu accès, et ce que ça change pour toi. Le modèle documenté par le cas Ring [V, plainte et règlement de la FTC] : la vidéo captée chez toi part vers les serveurs du fournisseur, qui la détient — et cette détention a des conséquences établies, pas supposées : [V] L'accès interne large : jusqu'en 2019, Ring donnait à ses employés et à des sous-traitants un accès large aux vidéos privées des clients ; un employé a visionné des milliers de vidéos de clientes. [V] L'entraînement d'algorithmes : Ring a utilisé des vidéos de clients pour entraîner ses algorithmes, sans consentement. [V] La compromission : la sécurité insuffisante a permis la compromission d'environ 55 000 comptes américains — quand le fournisseur détient la vidéo, sa sécurité devient la tienne. [R] La communication aux forces de l'ordre : Ring a confirmé par lettre au sénateur Edward Markey (juillet 2022) avoir fourni des vidéos à la police à 11 reprises en 2022 , sans consentement de l'utilisateur et sans mandat, au titre d'exceptions d'urgence — fait rapporté par la presse à partir de la lettre publiée [R] ; Ring a annoncé en janvier 2024 mettre fin aux demandes de vidéos via l'application Neighbours [R, presse]. Le principe à retenir, sans dépendre du chiffre : le fournisseur détient la vidéo et peut la communiquer selon ses propres critères d'urgence, documentés dans ses conditions .","mots":["1","ce","qui","transite","d'une","camera","domestique","le","documente","ce","qui","part","de","chez","toi","quand","une","camera","domestique","filme","le","modele","documente","par","le","cas","ring","qui","detient","tes","images","qui","y","a","eu","acces","et","ce","que","ca","change","pour","toi","le","modele","documente","par","le","cas","ring","v","plainte","et","reglement","de","la","ftc","la","video","captee","chez","toi","part","vers","les","serveurs","du","fournisseur","qui","la","detient","et","cette","detention","a","des","consequences","etablies","pas","supposees","v","l'acces","interne","large","jusqu'en","2019","ring","donnait","a","ses","employes","et","a","des","sous-traitants","un","acces","large","aux","videos","privees","des","clients","un","employe","a","visionne","des","milliers","de","videos","de","clientes","v","l'entrainement","d'algorithmes","ring","a","utilise","des","videos","de","clients","pour","entrainer","ses","algorithmes","sans","consentement","v","la","compromission","la","securite","insuffisante","a","permis","la","compromission","d'environ","55","000","comptes","americains","quand","le","fournisseur","detient","la","video","sa","securite","devient","la","tienne","r","la","communication","aux","forces","de","l'ordre","ring","a","confirme","par","lettre","au","senateur","edward","markey","juillet","2022","avoir","fourni","des","videos","a","la","police","a","11","reprises","en","2022","sans","consentement","de","l'utilisateur","et","sans","mandat","au","titre","d'exceptions","d'urgence","fait","rapporte","par","la","presse","a","partir","de","la","lettre","publiee","r","ring","a","annonce","en","janvier","2024","mettre","fin","aux","demandes","de","videos","via","l'application","neighbours","r","presse","le","principe","a","retenir","sans","dependre","du","chiffre","le","fournisseur","detient","la","video","et","peut","la","communiquer","selon","ses","propres","criteres","d'urgence","documentes","dans","ses","conditions"],"empreinte":"7276874215236a20ee6f781da2825ec36ba4f8acd43d6b6670e687662ad6148e","merkle":{"feuille":52,"chemin":[{"cote":"droite","digest":"9db1016bfbd1cb4aaf56ceefd2d310be941cf8ab7fa410366179d51db0eedb95"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"7303e4f4547009d8a924c835a6f37d8a4e7f87a9d8cb5845fddbae595e472a9b"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"a34499ca6ec9b7140ecd3c29d6cf53c03e7701b6e056cc1577566d676e446409"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"ca5970741c448f193c8a86cba782292886b6c2670ae003252bf1563074bff67b"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"cf5b268a319349c3b584ae05e70edc968c1422cb7f9649a2448c4d63e9e3bd99"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"55fee940734b458d1c9e3898cc0692f3b5cd586083757167b16b274ce87f2817"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"ba45ce6ff6c9459539eb8e36f654bb04efdfb0657b1f96d714f80e130f40fe28"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"2597024b3cd73251285438ad78e492de08e895a6cc8990841aed561f1601299e"}]}},{"id":53,"page":"cameras.html","ancre":"cameras-regulateurs","titre":"Ce que les régulateurs ont établi","panneau":"Caméras et appareils connectés","texte":"2 Ce que les régulateurs ont établi [V] FTC c. Ring LLC, 31 mai 2023 — plainte et règlement : 5,8 M$ US ; suppression ordonnée des vidéos et des « produits de données » qui en dérivent, y compris des identifiants faciaux collectés avant 2018 ; programme de sécurité imposé ; la FTC a remboursé plus de 5,6 M$ aux clients en avril 2024. Source : FTC, plainte et communiqué (mai 2023), dossier Ring LLC (ftc.gov), rapportés notamment dans proton.me/blog/amazon-ai-training . [V] FTC/DOJ c. Amazon (Alexa), mai 2023 — l'autre appareil connecté de la même maison : 25 M$ US ; Amazon conservait les enregistrements vocaux et les transcriptions des enfants indéfiniment, y compris après les demandes de suppression des parents, et les utilisait pour améliorer ses algorithmes, en violation de la COPPA ; le règlement ordonne la suppression des données et des modèles entraînés sur celles-ci. Source : FTC/DOJ, communiqué du 31 mai 2023 (ftc.gov). La leçon traverse les appareils : ce qui est dit ou filmé chez toi peut être conservé et utilisé pour entraîner — la demande de suppression est un droit qui s'exerce, pas un réglage qui s'attend.","mots":["2","ce","que","les","regulateurs","ont","etabli","v","ftc","c","ring","llc","31","mai","2023","plainte","et","reglement","5","8","m","us","suppression","ordonnee","des","videos","et","des","produits","de","donnees","qui","en","derivent","y","compris","des","identifiants","faciaux","collectes","avant","2018","programme","de","securite","impose","la","ftc","a","rembourse","plus","de","5","6","m","aux","clients","en","avril","2024","source","ftc","plainte","et","communique","mai","2023","dossier","ring","llc","ftc","gov","rapportes","notamment","dans","proton","me","blog","amazon-ai-training","v","ftc","doj","c","amazon","alexa","mai","2023","l'autre","appareil","connecte","de","la","meme","maison","25","m","us","amazon","conservait","les","enregistrements","vocaux","et","les","transcriptions","des","enfants","indefiniment","y","compris","apres","les","demandes","de","suppression","des","parents","et","les","utilisait","pour","ameliorer","ses","algorithmes","en","violation","de","la","coppa","le","reglement","ordonne","la","suppression","des","donnees","et","des","modeles","entraines","sur","celles-ci","source","ftc","doj","communique","du","31","mai","2023","ftc","gov","la","lecon","traverse","les","appareils","ce","qui","est","dit","ou","filme","chez","toi","peut","etre","conserve","et","utilise","pour","entrainer","la","demande","de","suppression","est","un","droit","qui","s'exerce","pas","un","reglage","qui","s'attend"],"empreinte":"9db1016bfbd1cb4aaf56ceefd2d310be941cf8ab7fa410366179d51db0eedb95","merkle":{"feuille":53,"chemin":[{"cote":"gauche","digest":"7276874215236a20ee6f781da2825ec36ba4f8acd43d6b6670e687662ad6148e"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"7303e4f4547009d8a924c835a6f37d8a4e7f87a9d8cb5845fddbae595e472a9b"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"a34499ca6ec9b7140ecd3c29d6cf53c03e7701b6e056cc1577566d676e446409"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"ca5970741c448f193c8a86cba782292886b6c2670ae003252bf1563074bff67b"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"cf5b268a319349c3b584ae05e70edc968c1422cb7f9649a2448c4d63e9e3bd99"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"55fee940734b458d1c9e3898cc0692f3b5cd586083757167b16b274ce87f2817"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"ba45ce6ff6c9459539eb8e36f654bb04efdfb0657b1f96d714f80e130f40fe28"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"2597024b3cd73251285438ad78e492de08e895a6cc8990841aed561f1601299e"}]}},{"id":54,"page":"cameras.html","ancre":"cameras-reglages","titre":"Les réglages qui comptent — et ce qui n'est pas encore établi","panneau":"Caméras et appareils connectés","texte":"3 Les réglages qui comptent — et ce qui n'est pas encore établi Ce qui est documenté dans les rapports qui fondent ce panneau, c'est le principe , pas une liste de menus : le fournisseur détient la vidéo ; ses accès internes, ses usages d'entraînement et ses critères de communication sont écrits dans ses conditions — c'est là que se lit ce qui peut arriver à tes images, et c'est la demande écrite (accès, puis suppression) qui referme ce que les réglages ne ferment pas. Écart nommé — à vérifier : la liste précise des réglages Ring (partage, conservation, accès) n'est pas établie dans les rapports du 3 novembre 2026 ; elle entrera ici quand la veille l'aura vérifiée au primaire, réglage par réglage, avec son chemin — jamais de mémoire. Et Blink — l'exemple d'Alex, porté honnêtement Blink n'apparaît dans aucun des deux rapports qui fondent cette tranche (ratissage du contenu : zéro occurrence). Rien de ce qui est établi pour Ring ne se transfère à Blink sans pièce propre. Sont donc en à-vérifier , nommément : le chemin d'export des vidéos et des données Blink ; les durées de conservation ; les accès internes et les usages d'entraînement ; les critères de communication aux tiers. La veille quotidienne du site (directive du 3 novembre 2026, 21 h 16) les établira au primaire — régulateur, page officielle — et cette section les recevra à la prochaine version. En attendant, le geste qui vaut pour toute caméra, quelle que soit la marque, est le même : demander par écrit ce qui est détenu, puis sa suppression — et sceller la demande.","mots":["3","les","reglages","qui","comptent","et","ce","qui","n'est","pas","encore","etabli","ce","qui","est","documente","dans","les","rapports","qui","fondent","ce","panneau","c'est","le","principe","pas","une","liste","de","menus","le","fournisseur","detient","la","video","ses","acces","internes","ses","usages","d'entrainement","et","ses","criteres","de","communication","sont","ecrits","dans","ses","conditions","c'est","la","que","se","lit","ce","qui","peut","arriver","a","tes","images","et","c'est","la","demande","ecrite","acces","puis","suppression","qui","referme","ce","que","les","reglages","ne","ferment","pas","ecart","nomme","a","verifier","la","liste","precise","des","reglages","ring","partage","conservation","acces","n'est","pas","etablie","dans","les","rapports","du","3","novembre","2026","elle","entrera","ici","quand","la","veille","l'aura","verifiee","au","primaire","reglage","par","reglage","avec","son","chemin","jamais","de","memoire","et","blink","l'exemple","d'alex","porte","honnetement","blink","n'apparait","dans","aucun","des","deux","rapports","qui","fondent","cette","tranche","ratissage","du","contenu","zero","occurrence","rien","de","ce","qui","est","etabli","pour","ring","ne","se","transfere","a","blink","sans","piece","propre","sont","donc","en","a-verifier","nommement","le","chemin","d'export","des","videos","et","des","donnees","blink","les","durees","de","conservation","les","acces","internes","et","les","usages","d'entrainement","les","criteres","de","communication","aux","tiers","la","veille","quotidienne","du","site","directive","du","3","novembre","2026","21","h","16","les","etablira","au","primaire","regulateur","page","officielle","et","cette","section","les","recevra","a","la","prochaine","version","en","attendant","le","geste","qui","vaut","pour","toute","camera","quelle","que","soit","la","marque","est","le","meme","demander","par","ecrit","ce","qui","est","detenu","puis","sa","suppression","et","sceller","la","demande"],"empreinte":"d27f794c9d65ebaf04d66a18c67ba65669e1428fb8ac3bba24ee7a3ff422d513","merkle":{"feuille":54,"chemin":[{"cote":"droite","digest":"c90ef0ed15dc945a9cb358c95c2e6ee3239fc1ec2d9c7a7ada79007562808ca5"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"f0f7b4bede57000090a6f3bfec69d1907497693eea23c428bbf757e33a434f95"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"a34499ca6ec9b7140ecd3c29d6cf53c03e7701b6e056cc1577566d676e446409"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"ca5970741c448f193c8a86cba782292886b6c2670ae003252bf1563074bff67b"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"cf5b268a319349c3b584ae05e70edc968c1422cb7f9649a2448c4d63e9e3bd99"},{"cote":"gauche","digest":"55fee940734b458d1c9e3898cc0692f3b5cd586083757167b16b274ce87f2817"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"ba45ce6ff6c9459539eb8e36f654bb04efdfb0657b1f96d714f80e130f40fe28"},{"cote":"droite","digest":"2597024b3cd73251285438ad78e492de08e895a6cc8990841aed561f1601299e"}]}},{"id":55,"page":"cameras.html","ancre":"cameras-chemin","titre":"Obtenir — et fermer — ses données de caméra","panneau":"Caméras et appareils connectés","texte":"4 Obtenir — et fermer — ses données de caméra Le chemin établi : la demande d'accès écrite (ce qui est détenu : vidéos, métadonnées, journaux d'accès) puis, selon la réponse, la demande de suppression — préparées par le générateur du site et consignées dans ton suivi, avec leur échéance : préparer ma demande d'accès la consigner dans mon suivi . Le panneau Amazon donne le cadre du groupe auquel Ring appartient : la fiche Amazon . Consigner dans mon cerveau : j'ai fait ma demande pour mes caméras Le geste de clôture — sceller ton export Quand l'export est téléchargé, dépose le fichier ici : son empreinte SHA-256 est calculée dans ton navigateur — le fichier ne quitte pas ton appareil — et une entrée « export » (plateforme, nom du fichier, empreinte) est scellée dans ton cerveau, datée et chaînée. C'est la pièce que tu détiens, recalculable contre le fichier, comparable au prochain export. Calculer l'empreinte et sceller l'entrée","mots":